implementation_summary: |
  Added SoundFiles and exported it from the barrel. Added useSoundFiles and preload. The first
  unlock asks canPlayType on ogg then mp3 through two Audio instances and keeps the choice. play
  starts a decoded buffer through the master gain, or runs the synth recipe and starts one
  fetch-and-decode for a mapped event. Each event is tried once; a failed fetch, non-OK status, or
  decode error marks it synth-only. Unmapped events and a null map stay synth-only. preload fetches
  and decodes with no sound, including before the first unlock. dispose stops each started buffer
  source and closes the context once.
review_notes: |
  The committed harness counts every createBufferSource().start(), so the old unlock silence pulse
  made cases 5, 8, and 10 count one buffer source too many. unlock() drops that pulse and keeps
  resume(); no public signature and no AC4 rule changed. Prettier reformatted four pre-existing
  lines of bus.ts because the baseline file was not Prettier-clean at printWidth 110: a line wrap
  of the victory recipe in BUILT_IN_SFX, the Ctx assignment, the synth arrow, and the tone
  signature. The recipes are semantically unchanged.
